spice

Uf   2f 0 8 8 1a fast inv
Us   2s 0 8 8 1b slow inv

.model fast logic ( delay= .8u )
.model slow logic ( delay= .8n )

.list
*.dc
.list

Vdd  8  0  dc 5.
vpulse 1b 0 pulse iv=0 pv=5 rise=1n fall=1n period=2u width=1u
vpulse 1a 0 pulse iv=0 pv=5 rise=1n fall=1n period=2u width=1u

.print tran v nodes
.tran 2u

.end
